    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the input management system for keyboard and mouse events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides input state tracking and event binding functionality. Callbacks can be registered for keyboard events, mouse button events, mouse movement, and mouse scrolling. </para>
